# A whole 15-minute SMART DJ set (0.16.24), played through with no hands: START SET from the SMART DJ page, ARC, Journey Near, Mixes Auto.
# The set's pace is half (shorter grooves and breakdowns), the opening intro 45 s (a twentieth of the set); a drop aimed at the arc's peak (10:30)
# lands just before it; pieces mix from one to the next; the close begins so that the music stops at 15:00.
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 36
spin K2 -2
wait 50
expect fxs101 0
expect smpace 50
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect playing 1
expect djon 1
expect smsec <3
shot set15_start.png
tap FX
wait 200
# the opening: 45 s of tracks coming in
waitfor introk 100 60000
expect smsec >40
expect smsec <50
expect smpatience <41
# a first mix into a new piece
waitfor tx >0 400000
waitfor tx 0 60000
# the peak's drop, aimed: it lands just before 10:30
waitfor smpeakat >0 700000
expect smpeakat >595
expect smpeakat <631
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
shot set15_peak.png
tap FX
wait 200
# the close, timed: the music stops at 15:00
waitfor ssout >0 400000
expect smsec >820
waitfor ssdone 1 120000
wait 100
expect playing 0
expect smsec >885
expect smsec <915
